            {
              "id": "tx04a1bc",
              "elType": "widget",
              "widgetType": "text-editor",
              "settings": {
                "editor": "<p>The kitchen is led by Executive Chef Julia du Toit, with guidance from FYN Group's Peter Tempelhoff and Ashley Moss, taking its cue from the ramen shops of Japan. Authentic techniques and carefully-selected ingredients reach beyond the bowls — the menu features Japanese street food including okonomiyaki fries and chicken karaage, while the bar pours award-winning cocktails, local and imported beers, and sake served from traditional masu cups.</p>",
                "text_color": "#a6a39f",
                "typography_typography": "custom",
                "typography_font_family": "Poppins",
                "typography_font_size": {
                  "unit": "px",
                  "size": 16
                },
